{"id":"624875","name":"红豆蒸饼","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/624875/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"红豆","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"40克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红豆用清水浸泡6个小时。","img":"images/624875/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入压力锅煮熟。","img":"images/624875/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮熟出锅，放入红糖。","img":"images/624875/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碾压成红豆沙备用。","img":"images/624875/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面粉和酵母粉混合，用温水和面。","img":"images/624875/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"和成软硬适中的面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/624875/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"发酵好了，有了很多蜂窝状的气孔。","img":"images/624875/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"移至面板，揉匀排气，分成小剂子。","img":"images/624875/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取一份，擀成圆片，放入适量红豆沙。","img":"images/624875/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"像包包子一样包起来。","img":"images/624875/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"收口朝下，按扁，再次发酵。","img":"images/624875/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"二次发酵后，放入蒸锅蒸制20分钟，焖3分钟。","img":"images/624875/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅啦。","img":"images/624875/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"500克面粉加放5克酵母。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}